# Build system

```bash
make setup | build | install | all | repl | test | sanitize
```

- CMake 3.26+, C++17, macOS 13.3+
- `make build` = two CMake runs + `lipo`:
  - **arm64**: `XPWELLYS_USE_LOCAL_INFERENCE=ON` → `build-arm64/`
  - **x86_64**: `XPWELLYS_USE_LOCAL_INFERENCE=OFF` → `build-x86_64/`
  - Output: `build/xp_wellys_vfr_atc.xpl` (+ arm64 `libpiper` / `libonnxruntime` staged)
- Windows builds in CI only (MSVC Ninja); needs `CMAKE_MSVC_RUNTIME_LIBRARY=MultiThreaded` (`/MT`)
- Windows artifact name must be `win_x64/xp_wellys_vfr_atc.xpl` (not `win.xpl`)
- Local backends must not use libcurl; curl is for downloader + cloud clients
- Vendor (`sdk/`, `vendor/`, spike third_party) via `make setup` — never commit those trees
- `make sanitize` instruments engine only — not the live `.xpl` in X-Plane
